Docs only.

- **`docs/hub-plan.md`**: the plan for the next group of work. The gateway becomes the hub every request goes through:
  - a request ledger and board;
  - queues, limits and deadlines;
  - duplicate and conflict detection across sessions;
  - health checks, circuit breakers and labelled fallbacks, with one error contract;
  - usage meters (OpenRouter, NEAR AI, the Claude plan, ChatGPT, local) and per-step provider ladders down to a local model;
  - project capsules and a size watcher, to keep sessions small and save credits.

  It is split into four phases and ends with the decisions still open.
- **`docs/hosting-options.md`**: a dated reference to update over time. It covers the local-first decision, the dropped droplet, GitHub Codespaces, and what Hugging Face Spaces, Inference Endpoints and Inference Providers would mean here.
- **`docs/mcp-clients.md`** links to both.

